# Gustra UI & edit conventions

Primary stack: React Native, Expo Router (SDK 57), TypeScript, Reanimated, Gesture Handler. Prefer small diffs — do not rewrite whole files when a local edit suffices.

Do **not** duplicate data/i18n/plan/dump rules — those live in their own `.mdc` files.

## Design tokens

- Colors/theme from `@/constants/Colors` and `@/constants/Theme` only — no one-off palette.
- Defaults: `GustraColors.cream` (bg), `GustraColors.forestGreen` (accent), `GustraColors.bubble` (cards/inputs), `GustraColors.ink` (text).
- Titles/headers: `SerifText`. Body/caption: `Text` + `bodyTextStyle` / `captionTextStyle`.
- Layout: `StyleSheet.create`. Respect `useSafeAreaInsets` and `Theme.spacing.floatingTabBarClearance` under the floating tab bar.

## Platform chrome

- iOS: `expo-symbols` (`SymbolView`), native `Stack`.
- Android: `@expo/vector-icons/MaterialIcons`, `JsStack` with bezier timing (avoid spring flash on back). See `app/(tabs)/(main)/_layout.tsx`.
- Prefer OS-native patterns when adding interactive UI (see `native-platform-ui.mdc`).

## Accessibility

- Touchables (`Pressable`): set `accessibilityRole` and `accessibilityLabel` (via `t('…')` when user-facing).
